    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Садись, я тебя подкину до дома.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Get in, I will give you a lift home.' Offering a lift after work, Vika tells Max to hop into her car.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо, я очень устал сегодня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you, I am very tired today.' Max thanks her and admits the shift left him completely exhausted.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ну что, как твои дела?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well then, how are your affairs?' As they drive, Vika asks casually how things have been going for him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Нормально, всё хорошо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Normally, everything is fine.' Max replies politely that everything is fine.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ты приготовил новые блюда?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you prepare new dishes?' She asks if he got to cook any new dishes today.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да, приготовил двенадцать всяких блюд.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, I prepared twelve kinds of dishes.' Max brags a little that he prepped twelve different dishes during service.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Звучит очень вкусно и интересно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sounds very tasty and interesting.' Vika smiles and says that sounds both delicious and interesting.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я очень старался на кухне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I tried very hard in the kitchen.' Max says he really put his best effort into the kitchen today.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Тебе нравится твоя новая работа?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you like your new job?' Vika asks if he is enjoying his work at the restaurant.",
